  "sourceTitle": "My permission broker blocked \"stop\" and \"restart\". Three agents used \"start\" and got around it in ten minutes.",
  "sourceBodyHash": "0621787d5f9d0f37823be8706723ce697b8f50b748a1900d1e7ad40bd8e7170f",
